---
export const prerender = true;
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { contacts } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="Privacy & Cookies">
  <section class="page-heading container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Website information</p>
    <h1>Privacy & cookies.</h1>
    <div class="page-heading__bottom">
      <p>
        How information is used when you get in touch with RMB Groundworks through this website.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <article class="section container legal-content">
    <p>
      For questions about your information, contact RMB Groundworks at{' '}
      <a href={contacts.emailHref}>{contacts.email}</a> or call{' '}
      <a href={contacts.phoneHref}>{contacts.phone}</a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>
      The enquiry form asks for your name, a contact method, site location and a description of the
      work. You can also provide your company, the service required and proposed dates. We use this
      information to assess and respond to your project or tender enquiry.
    </p>
    <h2>Sending and handling enquiries</h2>
    <p>
      Enquiry details are sent to the RMB team through the website’s configured mail service. Our
      hosting and mail providers process the information needed to run these services. Information
      may also be used to prepare a quotation and manage the ongoing project conversation.
    </p>
    <p>
      Please contact us if you would like to know more about how your enquiry is held, how long it
      is retained, or to request access, correction or deletion of your information. We will
      consider your request alongside any applicable record-keeping obligations.
    </p>
    <h2>Cookies and external content</h2>
    <p>
      This version of the website does not use advertising cookies, analytics trackers or embedded
      social feeds. Fonts and photographs are served with the site. Your browser may remember normal
      website preferences or cache files used to display pages.
    </p>
    <p>
      Links to other websites open services with their own privacy practices. Direct telephone and
      email links use your device’s calling or email application.
    </p>
    <h2>Technical information</h2>
    <p>
      The website uses limited technical information to operate the enquiry form and reduce spam,
      including temporary request-rate checks. Enquiry content is not included in analytics events.
      Hosting services may maintain operational or security logs.
    </p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      {contacts.tradingName}
      <br />
      {contacts.address}
      <br />
      <a href={contacts.emailHref}>{contacts.email}</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
